BODY=Call the review_diff MCP tool over the HTTP/JSON-RPC Function URL (and stdio) with a unified diff not attached to any PR; confirm tools/list advertises both tools, findings come back, passing repo loads that repo's .mergewatch.yml + conventions while omitting it does not, description reaches the agent prompts, the stored review is agentAuthored:true, grounding still applies, and malformed params return -32602. No fixture PR.
